    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Okay, start at the start. What exactly is a deepfake?",
      "chapter": "What is a deepfake?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "It's a video, photo, or voice recording made or changed with AI, so it looks like a real person did something they never did.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Deepfake = AI-made fake",
        "cue": "video",
        "sub": "video • photo • voice",
        "sub_cue": "voice"
      },
      "punch": "never"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "How do people even make those?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "The AI studies lots of photos or recordings of a person. It learns their face or voice, then makes new ones that copy them.",
      "board": {
        "type": "journey",
        "title": "HOW A DEEPFAKE IS MADE",
        "traveler": "🤖",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🖼️",
